<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post7434783624351624675..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: &quot;The Threat of Authority&quot; </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>13</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-769249679012035592</id><published>2012-08-21T02:25:34.424-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-21T02:25:34.424-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Hits close home Will. Too close. I have had cops, ...</title><content type='html'>Hits close home Will. Too close. I have had cops, under color of law, violate me many times, and they never go to jail and always get away with it.   Keep on doing what you do. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In Liberty!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/769249679012035592'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/769249679012035592'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345537534424#c769249679012035592' title=''/><author><name>Inalienablewrights</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1848259208"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 21, 2012 at 2:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8340763776184091902</id><published>2012-08-19T16:33:25.827-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-19T16:33:25.827-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks again for your work, Will... Thanks to all ...</title><content type='html'> Thanks again for your work, Will... Thanks to all the above comments, as well... Good to know there are still some non-conformists and free thinkers left in the USSA... Too bad I can&amp;#39;t find anyone in my little world with these attributes... Sports, American Idol, and other distractions seem to dominate people&amp;#39;s lives... Really sad...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/8340763776184091902'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/8340763776184091902'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345415605827#c8340763776184091902' title=''/><author><name>Syntek99</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-87828862"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 19, 2012 at 4:33 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3365598241348819688</id><published>2012-08-18T08:24:37.805-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-18T08:24:37.805-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The Milgram and Zimbardo experiments are frighteni...</title><content type='html'>The Milgram and Zimbardo experiments are frightening but everyone needs to know about them so they can resist authority. But people aren&amp;#39;t listening.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Police searching for bank robbers forced 40 people out of their cars at gunpoint and handcuffed them for more than two hours while they searched their cars. Not one of the people who used to be innocent until proven guilty objected. But they do not need to give consent.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/3365598241348819688'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/3365598241348819688'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345299877805#c3365598241348819688' title=''/><author><name>theruleoffreedom</name><uri>http://theruleoffreedom.wordpress.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/openid16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-359514444"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 18, 2012 at 8:24 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-688028605103098492</id><published>2012-08-17T19:32:53.999-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-17T19:32:53.999-06:00</updated><title type='text'>three years ago I explained all of this:  Nature m...</title><content type='html'>three years ago I explained all of this:  Nature made almost all of us stupid and obedient to turhority &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Orwells Boot&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Enter the two words orwells boot into any search engine.  The item(s)&lt;br /&gt;that come up under the names factotum666 or dnusbaum.com, usually first or second, are mine.  If you think that those words are special, then use either orwell or boot, and almost any combination of: obedience, tyranny,  government, authority.  My article will be either 1st or 2nd.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I would like to do something with the popularity of this 6000 word article, either by way of talks / speeches or working on expanding the ideas in the article.  I am currently doing that at http://xfoolnature.org/?p=10&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Where I also offer some easy to implement ideas as to how to address, and possibly remedy the problem.  There are specific actions that you can do to change things.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Doug Nusbaum 702 457-3089  dpaladin at ix dot netcom dot com</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/688028605103098492'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/688028605103098492'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345253573999#c688028605103098492' title=''/><author><name>Factotum</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03527759941568644473</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-119060789"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2012 at 7:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4100764859473785781</id><published>2012-08-17T17:51:23.212-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-17T17:51:23.212-06:00</updated><title type='text'>feminism and PC is the new Milgram methodology&#xa;&#xa;if...</title><content type='html'>feminism and PC is the new Milgram methodology&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;if you refuse to submit, youre a misogynist or racist -- a proponent of &amp;quot;hate&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;hate speech&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;far more instances of authoritarian evil in amerika are inflicted on boys and men than on females, and women are much more amenable to totalitarianism/fascism (that was true in the Reich, also)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;a good article, as usual, this planet doesnt deserve you&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/4100764859473785781'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/4100764859473785781'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345247483212#c4100764859473785781' title=''/><author><name>ray</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11380746207592226835</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2087141373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2012 at 5:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3997470866589938566</id><published>2012-08-17T14:40:02.615-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-17T14:40:02.615-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It took seeing the police-state in action in my ow...</title><content type='html'>It took seeing the police-state in action in my own living room, on ME, for my wife to snap out of her own cultural conditioning.  Prior to that she&amp;#39;d have said it was all &amp;quot;talk&amp;quot; but now she&amp;#39;s seen it first hand and personal and now sees it for what it is:  Brute force untethered to any morals.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/3997470866589938566'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/3997470866589938566'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345236002615#c3997470866589938566' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-503858410"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2012 at 2:40 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4260725269658235904</id><published>2012-08-17T13:48:55.228-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-17T13:48:55.228-06:00</updated><title type='text'>If we&amp;#39;re making a list of who is responsible f...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt; If we&amp;#39;re making a list of who is responsible for what happened to Ms. Ogborn, we ought to include every teacher, talking head on TV, or peer (and probably her parents), who passed on to Ms. Ogborn the completely bogus idea that obedience to &amp;quot;authority&amp;quot; is a moral obligation.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Don&amp;#39;t leave clergy off of this list.  I cannot tell you how many &amp;quot;churches&amp;quot; I&amp;#39;ve attended in the last few years where, seemingly every Sunday, there is an exhortation worked into the sermon somewhere to &amp;quot;defer to government authority.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/4260725269658235904'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/4260725269658235904'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345232935228#c4260725269658235904' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2012 at 1:48 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6145675679194449698</id><published>2012-08-17T09:57:36.715-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-17T09:57:36.715-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Here are 3 loosely-related links...&#xa;&#xa;Why We Fight&#xa;...</title><content type='html'>Here are 3 loosely-related links...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://aaeblog.com/2009/04/26/why-we-fight-the-power/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Why We Fight&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9tf2WsC-Aso&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;The Chain of Obedience&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=okPnDZ1Txlo&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Obedience Training&lt;/a&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/6145675679194449698'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/6145675679194449698'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345219056715#c6145675679194449698' title=''/><author><name>James</name><uri>https://www.facebook.com/incaseyoumissedit</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-823451251"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2012 at 9:57 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5082936884831138933</id><published>2012-08-17T08:17:09.768-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-17T08:17:09.768-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Apparently the Milgram experiment was repeated mul...</title><content type='html'>Apparently the Milgram experiment was repeated multiple times with many variations. I recall reading that the few people who resisted the call of authority to commit evil were nonconformists in their own life. Beatniks, hippies, and so forth. What&amp;#39;s a more modern term, goths maybe? The usual run-of-the-mill conservatives don&amp;#39;t come out looking very good in such experiments. Gives a person a reason to appreciate hippies after all. Next time I hear a conservative dump on hippies, my response will be, &amp;quot;Milgram Experiment&amp;quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/5082936884831138933'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/5082936884831138933'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345213029768#c5082936884831138933' title=''/><author><name>Paul Bonneau</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1327067672"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2012 at 8:17 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3110965344859924474</id><published>2012-08-17T08:05:20.617-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-17T08:05:20.617-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I wish I were more intelligent so I could express,...</title><content type='html'>I wish I were more intelligent so I could express, in words, how reading your words fits in to my little view of the world.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/3110965344859924474'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/3110965344859924474'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345212320617#c3110965344859924474' title=''/><author><name>Steve McCulley</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01098448101292483043</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh6.googleusercontent.com/-rAbftAcVaxQ/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAADM/rLmj7upXk4w/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-236575419"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2012 at 8:05 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-76697716695695736</id><published>2012-08-17T04:53:53.286-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-17T04:53:53.286-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Once again your observations ring plain and simple...</title><content type='html'>Once again your observations ring plain and simple truth. Nice to see Larken also follows your blog as I follow and love the simplicity and truth of his writings and YouTube posts. Will I&amp;#39;ve read all your stuff and have been falsely arrested and imprisoned 3 times in the US. However the last 2 times I actually had the knowledge of &amp;quot;THE LAW&amp;quot; on my side and destroyed the ignorant, brain damaged, delusional badged idiots that did the arresting. Trust me coming out of the STATE indoctrinated paradigm is rough as I am a 17 year naval vet, and was pretty thoroughly indoctrinated into the lies of the fictions. Love your blog and books and appreciate your insight.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;StimuL8&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;your mind Use it for something other than &amp;quot;Blind Obedience.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/76697716695695736'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/76697716695695736'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345200833286#c76697716695695736' title=''/><author><name>Patrick Henry</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09590826175356201052</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_DpjLyu9kVxo/TCZxmfx1-AI/AAAAAAAAABc/QW_L9Lers2w/S220/Jim01.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-865900832"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 17, 2012 at 4:53 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1028910092872664110</id><published>2012-08-16T21:35:18.169-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-16T21:35:18.169-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Great article, though horribly frustrating to read...</title><content type='html'>Great article, though horribly frustrating to read, simply because it&amp;#39;s so infuriating to have all these examples, and have most people STILL imagine that teaching subservience to &amp;quot;authority&amp;quot; is a good idea. If we&amp;#39;re making a list of who is responsible for what happened to Ms. Ogborn, we ought to include every teacher, talking head on TV, or peer (and probably her parents), who passed on to Ms. Ogborn the completely bogus idea that obedience to &amp;quot;authority&amp;quot; is a moral obligation. Most parents are TRAINING their children to react this way to so-called &amp;quot;authority&amp;quot; figures. Anyway, thanks for the great article, as frustrating as it is to read. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/1028910092872664110'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7434783624351624675/comments/default/1028910092872664110'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html?showComment=1345174518169#c1028910092872664110' title=''/><author><name>Larken Rose</name><uri>http://www.larkenrose.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-threat-of-authority.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7434783624351624675' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7434783624351624675' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2131797916"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 16, 2012 at 9:35 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7592978876242936572</id><published>2012-08-16T20:48:31.056-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-16T20:48:31.056-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Bad ass post, dude. I am loving this blog. How did...</title><content type='html'>Bad ass post, dude. I am loving this blog. How did regular Germans go along with Nazi directives? Exactly as you describe. How is that reflected in America? 